Absence has two shapes, and the second one is the one that used to crash: a
normalized submission carries [[preview_url]] with an empty value rather than no
attribute at all.
Both shapes must yield [[None]], and neither may raise.

<<test functions>>=
class TestSpeedgraderWithoutPreviewURL:
